  "summary": "The IP Multimedia Subsystem: P-, I-, and S-CSCF with the HSS and SLF, application servers and media resources, PSTN breakout through the BGCF and MGCF, and interconnect through the IBCF and TrGW. Gm runs over the IMS PDN connection (EPC) or PDU session (5GC); the P-CSCF acts as the AF towards the PCRF over Rx and the PCF over N5.",
